WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.055 --> 00:00:03.520
KANG THE CONQUEROR
Scott Lang, you're an Avenger.

00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:07.309
But down here,
you're out of your league.

00:00:07.359 --> 00:00:08.067
[Screaming]

00:00:08.952 --> 00:00:11.285
JANET VAN DYNE
Kang can shatter timelines.

00:00:12.763 --> 00:00:14.857
KANG THE CONQUEROR
Everything you call a life...

00:00:14.908 --> 00:00:15.533
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

00:00:15.584 --> 00:00:16.366
KANG THE CONQUEROR
...will end.

00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:17.443
SCOTT LANG
And you're not getting out.

00:00:20.914 --> 00:00:24.533
I don't have to win.
We both just have to lose.

